                <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='16' italic='true'>Definitions </run>
              </formatted-text>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                <format attr='background-color' value='#333333' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
            <zone forceUpdate='true' h='60551' id='8' type-v2='text' w='100000' x='0' y='13378'>
              <formatted-text>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='15'>Backend Metrics</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Times New Roman,Times,Nimbus Roman No9 L,Liberation Serif,serif' fontsize='12'>‣ ABS (Average Basket Size / Average Quantity Ordered)</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='11'>: </run>
                <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='11'> Average number of items in a basket.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Times New Roman,Times,Nimbus Roman No9 L,Liberation Serif,serif' fontsize='12'>‣ AOV (Average OrderValue )</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='11'>: </run>
                <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='11'>  Average value of total amount paid by the customer</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Times New Roman,Times,Nimbus Roman No9 L,Liberation Serif,serif' fontsize='12'>‣ Orders</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='11'>: </run>
                <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='11'> Number of successful orders</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Times New Roman,Times,Nimbus Roman No9 L,Liberation Serif,serif' fontsize='12'>‣ Customer count</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='11'>: </run>
                <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='11'> Distinct count of customers who made an order in a selected period</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='15'>Frontend Metrics</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Times New Roman,Times,Nimbus Roman No9 L,Liberation Serif,serif' fontsize='12'>‣ Add to cart time average</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='11'>: </run>
                <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='11'> Time from the moment subcategory page has been loaded to add to cart event.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Arial' fontsize='8'>        - Boosted - Products that are boosted in the page</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Arial' fontsize='8'>        - Non-Boosted - Products that are not boosted in the page</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Times New Roman,Times,Nimbus Roman No9 L,Liberation Serif,serif' fontsize='12'>‣ Add to cart rank Norm (Average and Median)</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='11'>: </run>
                <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='11'>Normalised position of product (normalised to 0-1 interval) in category page.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontname='Times New Roman,Times,Nimbus Roman No9 L,Liberation Serif,serif' fontsize='12'>‣ Add to cart rank Abs (Average and Median)</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='11'>:  </run>
                <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='11'>Absolute position of a product in category page.</run>
              </formatted-text>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                <format attr='background-color' value='#555555' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
            <zone forceUpdate='true' h='7032' id='11' type-v2='text' w='100000' x='0' y='73929'>
