    <dashboard name='User Instructions'>
      <repository-location derived-from='https://tableau.deliveryhero.net/t/GlobalStandardReporting/workbooks/EntityLevelRanking/UserInstructions?rev=' id='UserInstructions' path='/t/GlobalStandardReporting/workbooks/EntityLevelRanking' revision='' site='GlobalStandardReporting' />
      <style />
      <size sizing-mode='automatic' />
      <zones>
        <zone h='100000' id='5' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
          <zone h='100000' id='4' param='vert' type-v2='layout-flow' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
            <zone forceUpdate='true' h='6346' id='6' type-v2='text' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
              <formatted-text>
                <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='16'>Report Usage Instructions</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              </formatted-text>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                <format attr='background-color' value='#000000' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
            <zone forceUpdate='true' h='93654' id='8' type-v2='text' w='100000' x='0' y='6346'>
              <formatted-text>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='15'>Dashboards:</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='12'>Æ  </run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='12'>&gt;&gt; Ranking Variation - </run>
                <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='12'>Shows the performance of ranking variations with respect to each other. Helps analyse the best performing variation for a selected metric. </run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='12'>Æ  </run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='12'>&gt;&gt; Daily Metrics-</run>
                <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='12'> gives a brief overview on how metrics have performed in the past month for different ranking variation</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='12'>Æ  </run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='12'>&gt;&gt; Weekday Metrics - </run>
                <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='12'>Gives an overview of ranking variation performance for all metrics on each day of the week</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='12'>Æ  </run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='12'>&gt;&gt; Single Metric Trend Over time </run>
                <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='12'>- Graphical view of metric performace with time for different ranking variations.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='12'>  &gt;&gt; Boxplot for ranking variations - </run>
                <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='12'>Box plots of overall ranking and daily boxplot for each ranking variation</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='12'>  &gt;&gt; Alerts - </run>
                <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='12'>Triggers alert mails when a parameter drops below a certain value( </run>
                <run fontcolor='#e15759' fontsize='12'>Currently GMV and Order countd</run>
                <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='12'>) . Only applicable to entities where POP_rank is launched.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='15'>Filters:</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='12'>   &gt;&gt; Date filters -</run>
                <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='12'> Default- 28th June 2021 to 25th July 2021</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='12'>Æ          </run>
                <run fontcolor='#e15759' fontsize='12'>Please  keep in mind the launch date for each entity.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='12'>          Limit date range to smaller ranges for better view and loading times. </run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='12'>          To avoid skewed data make sure the ranking variations are distributed evenly. </run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='12'>          Switchback test validity  28th June 2021 to 25th July 2021 for FP_BD, FP_PK, TB_KW (</run>
                <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='10' italic='true'>tracking metrics for TB_KW not available</run>
                <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='12'>)</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='12'>          POP_Rank launch date FP_DE &amp; NP_HU (17/08/2021) , FP_BD &amp; FP_PK (08/09/2021)</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='12'>Æ   </run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='12'>&gt;&gt; Global Entity ID - </run>
                <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='12'>For better insights, it is recommended to select on entity at a time. </run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='12'>Æ   </run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='12'>&gt;&gt; Weekday/weekend highlighter -</run>
                <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='12'> used to highlight weekend and weekdays in the selected date range (</run>
                <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='10' italic='true'>applies only to Table: All metrics by day, Weekday_variation, Single Metric Trend Over time)</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='12'>.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='12'>Æ   </run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='12'>&gt;&gt; Select Metric - </run>
                <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='12'>filter different metrics to check how each metric has performed for different variations(</run>
                <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='10' italic='true'>applies only to  Single Metric Trend Over time, Ranking_Variation).</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='12'>Æ   </run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='12'>&gt;&gt; Ranking Variation Select</run>
                <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='12'> - Select the ranking variations which has to be compared to other varitions (</run>
                <run fontcolor='#ffffff' fontsize='10' italic='true'>applies only to Ranking_Variation).</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
              </formatted-text>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                <format attr='background-color' value='#555555' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
          </zone>
        </zone>
      </zones>
